WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
If you want to go out, go outside the community

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:04,680
There are monsters and murderous bandits out there

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,480
Is this too dangerous?

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:09,560
Don't worry, I never fight a battle I'm not sure about.

5
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:12,400
If you are not 99% sure, you will never go out.

6
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,840
I will call Teacher Bai later

7
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,120
Has frost dominance and anti-injury protection

8
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:19,080
With Ziyun's bonus, self-protection is absolutely no problem

9
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:22,200
Kill the non-aggressive hexagonal monster and must-explode the treasure chest

10
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,000
Blueprints: Western Europe’s construction resources are booming thanks to this

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,250
This is a once-in-a-lifetime development opportunity

12
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,130
Then you must pay attention to safety

13
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:31,090
You are not just a homeowner

14
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:34,020
You are my man. I don’t want anything to happen to you.

15
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:41,140
Okay, ready to go

16
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:43,580
Although expensive, it can carry crossbows

17
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:44,620
Full of sense of security

18
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:47,460
Honey, it's dark outside. Take this.
